# Linux cron template for the daily jobcut run.
#
# Easiest path: set this up from the console (Settings → Automation) — it installs
# the crontab entry for you. This template is for doing it by hand.
#
# SETUP:
#   1. Replace the placeholders with your absolute paths.
#   2. Install:  crontab -e   (paste the line below)
#
#   {{JOBCUT_BIN}} = output of `which jobcut` (e.g. /home/you/.venv/bin/jobcut)
#   {{DATA_DIR}}     = your data dir (holds searches/, config/, the .db and out/)
#
# `jobcut daily` = pull + score + surface in one (a PAID Apify scrape). Add `--read`
# for a FREE re-download (dev). Runs every day at 07:20.

20 7 * * *  JOBCUT_DATA_DIR={{DATA_DIR}} {{JOBCUT_BIN}} daily >> {{DATA_DIR}}/jobcut.daily.log 2>&1
